# Sites waiting for their DNS. Each block moves into Caddyfile (and the server) only once its name, and its www,
# answer 13.63.125.132 and nothing else: Caddy asks for a certificate at once, and a name still parked at GoDaddy
# would fail and be retried. This file is never loaded by Caddy.

# Bold Pups' own domain, as Epic Pods has (GoDaddy's two parked A records, 76.223.105.230 and 13.248.243.5, go first).
boldpups.xyz {
	redir / /boldpups/ 302
	import cdn
	import app
}
www.boldpups.xyz {
	redir https://boldpups.xyz{uri} 301
}

# A city's domain opens its world in Phiegg (the Bold City of that name), as bozo.city does.
once.city, www.once.city {
	redir https://phiegg.com/phiegg/world/w_once_city 302
}
wand.city, www.wand.city {
	redir https://phiegg.com/phiegg/world/w_wand_city 302
}
acro.city, www.acro.city {
	redir https://phiegg.com/phiegg/world/w_acro_city 302
}

# Phiora's API at its own address, for tools and scripts (the apps call /api on their own domain, so cookies stick).
ora.phiegg.com {
	encode gzip
	rewrite * /api{uri}
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080 {
		flush_interval -1
	}
}
